flowchart TD
    Start([User Registers]) --> Admin[Admin Creates account]
    Admin --> Login[User Logs in]
    Login --> Dashboard[Dashboard]

    Dashboard --> Watchlist[Watchlist]
    Watchlist -->|Add| AddSymbol[Add Symbols]
    Watchlist -->|Remove| DelSymbol[Delete Symbols]

    Dashboard --> PlaceOrder[Place Order]

    PlaceOrder --> OrderType{Buy/Sell?}

    OrderType -->|Buy| CheckBalance[Check Balance]
    CheckBalance --> BuyOrder[Buy Order]

    OrderType -->|Sell| CheckPosition[Check Position]
    CheckPosition --> SellOrder[Sell Order]

    BuyOrder --> UpdatePos[Update Positions & balance]
    SellOrder --> UpdatePos

    UpdatePos --> End([Complete])

